{"id": "q0493", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "local", "tier": "never", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 3837589351, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "923cbbdfe3213927dfa36b1f8e0eb48a30d641d9b9bf7cf25d16765340d88836", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 5, "query": "设计国际妇女节活动海报。", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0493.wav", "input_sha256": "5cab842fcf0eccba7017b655bcbfa43388c0f3eaccf81625ccbb3ea496bce742", "input_samples": 40600, "input_s": 2.538, "n_real_chunks": 3, "score": 0.406, "act": 0.996, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "好的，那我来给你说说怎么设计国际妇女节活动的海报。首先颜色上可以用粉色、紫色或者浅蓝色，这些都是女性常见的颜色，看起来温暖又有力量感。然后标题要醒目一点，比如写上“庆祝国际妇女节”或者“致敬每一位勇敢的女性”。主图可以放一群女性在一起笑或者举手欢呼的照片，显得热闹又有爱。下面再写清楚活动时间、地点和主题，比如“共同成长，共创未来”。如果有赞助商或合作伙伴，也可以把他们的logo放在角落。整体风格要简洁大方，让人一眼就能看明白是什么活动。你觉得这样行吗？", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 45, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0493_local_local.wav", "sha256": "04fad4ff6e86762eefc5d8c1075bc315d0ddfa70e617281f4543da677c152b0c", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 44.64}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.063, 1.115, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.066, 2.118, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 2.538, 2.603, 2.654, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.538, 3.602, 4.001, 0, 24000, 0], [4, 0, 4.537, 4.602, 5.183, 0, 24000, 0], [5, 0, 5.537, 5.599, 6.151, 0, 24000, 0], [6, 0, 6.537, 6.602, 7.238, 0, 24000, 0], [7, 0, 7.537, 7.597, 8.105, 0, 24000, 0], [8, 0, 8.537, 8.602, 9.15, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 9.537, 9.599, 10.11, 0, 24000, 0], [10, 0, 10.537, 10.6, 11.146, 0, 24000, 0], [11, 0, 11.537, 11.6, 12.087, 0, 24000, 0], [12, 