{"id": "q0532", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "local", "tier": "never", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 1754678604, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "923cbbdfe3213927dfa36b1f8e0eb48a30d641d9b9bf7cf25d16765340d88836", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 5, "query": "为诗歌生成韵律方案。", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0532.wav", "input_sha256": "8344970e7fdf2df60daa8c21e5813d3bb630799afcc3e00fbfee253c78d6eb3a", "input_samples": 33200, "input_s": 2.075, "n_real_chunks": 3, "score": 0.6932, "act": 0.9116, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "好的，我来给你设计一个诗歌的韵律方案。首先我们可以选一个常见的诗歌形式，比如四行诗或者五言绝句都很适合初学者。假设我们用五言绝句吧，它有四行，每行五个字，结构简单又很有节奏感。它的基本韵律是平仄相间，通常第二和第四行押韵。比如说第一行是平平仄仄平，第二行对仗可以是仄仄平平仄，然后第三行再换回来平平仄仄平，最后一行结尾要和第二行押同一个韵，形成回环的效果。这样读起来朗朗上口，也容易记住。当然你也可以自由变通，不一定非得严格按规矩来。", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 55, "feed_lag_max_ms": 44, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 44, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0532_local_local.wav", "sha256": "d9302b8d3780670289f141065d7a97094cf348e4c835496408c0371090389066", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 54.52}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.065, 1.117, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.067, 2.12, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 2.075, 2.183, 2.236, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.075, 3.141, 3.768, 0, 24000, 0], [4, 0, 4.075, 4.142, 4.783, 0, 24000, 0], [5, 0, 5.075, 5.143, 5.808, 0, 24000, 0], [6, 0, 6.075, 6.143, 6.721, 0, 24000, 0], [7, 0, 7.075, 7.143, 7.737, 0, 24000, 0], [8, 0, 8.075, 8.144, 8.736, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 9.075, 9.142, 9.77, 0, 24000, 0], [10, 0, 10.075, 10.143, 10.684, 0, 24000, 0], [11, 0, 11.075, 11.143, 11.75, 0, 24000, 0], [12, 0, 12.0